Tree construction tests of html5lib-tests without parse errors, for the
sax tests: the cases of tree-construction/*.dat in the copy of the tests in
golang.org/x/net v0.60.0 (html/testdata/html5lib-tests/) whose #errors and
#new-errors sections are empty, other than #document-fragment cases and
cases without a doctype (in webkit02.dat, whose #errors sections leave out
the missing doctype and other parse errors). Each case is named after its
file and its number in the file, with the script-off or script-on flag of
the case, and has the #data section as in and the #document section as
document, unchanged. The tests are under the license in LICENSE.
-- blocks/2 --
-- in --
<!doctype html><address><p>foo</address>bar
-- document --
| <!DOCTYPE html>
| <html>
|   <head>
|   <body>
|     <address>
|       <p>
|         "foo"
|     "bar"
